  Status-bar icon for F/O message notifications.

  Android masks the small icon down to a single colour and discards everything
  but the alpha channel, so a full-colour launcher icon renders as a filled
  blob. It has to be a solid silhouette on transparency — this is the same
  chunky heart the app uses throughout, drawn to the 24dp system grid.
-->
